title: safe-script-collapse
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki-multiple

title: Narrative

Handled by: $:/core/modules/widgets/element.js

A tag name whose invalid characters would otherwise collapse onto `script`, and the same via the genesis widget's `$type`, must not reach the DOM as an executable element. `scr.ipt` keeps its dot (a valid custom-element character) and stays inert; `scr$ipt` and `scr_ipt` lose the invalid character and are neutered to `safe-script`.

+
title: Output

<scr$ipt type="text/javascript">alert("Hello")</scr$ipt>
<scr.ipt type="text/javascript">alert("Hello")</scr.ipt>
<$genesis $type="scr_ipt">alert("Hello")</$genesis>
+
title: ExpectedResult

<p><safe-script type="text/javascript">alert("Hello")</safe-script>
<scr.ipt type="text/javascript">alert("Hello")</scr.ipt>
<safe-script>alert("Hello")</safe-script></p>